 we want to make the behavior more consistent.\r\n\r\nThe change makes `NewSubConn()` with empty list return an error, and makes `UpdateAddress()` with empty list tear the addrConn down. The SubConn won't be usable after this.\r\n\r\nEventually we want to make the SubConn with empty address list stay in TransientFailure but still usable, and balancer still can update this SubConn's address.\r\n\r\nThis will be done in a follow-up PR. And let's keep this issue open to track this.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/comments/346484950/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/comments/397093406","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/issues/1683#issuecomment-397093406","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/1683","id":397093406,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM5NzA5MzQwNg==","user":{"login":"menghanl","id":960845,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2MDg0NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/960845?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/menghanl","html_url":"https://github.com/menghanl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menghanl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menghanl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menghanl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menghanl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menghanl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menghanl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menghanl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menghanl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/menghanl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":fa